<p><a href="https://www.zeemaps.com/map?group=1296235">https://www.zeemaps.com/map?group=1296235</a></p>
<p>Thanks to Guilliman, SCPs are mapped according to where they're found. Yet there're many countries not filled up (North American and Western Europe are practically saturated with SCPs).</p>
<p>Your challenge, should you choose to accept, is to make an SCP found/manifested in a country/dependency/state/province/sub-national division that has no SCPs on the map above. Pick your chosen area and start writing about what kind of SCP can the Foundation find in these &quot;frontiers&quot;.</p>

